#!/usr/bin/node
// panel-backup: the root helper behind the vps-panel Backups page.
//
// Installed root:root 0755 at /usr/local/sbin/panel-backup. The panel (user kapil) may run only this
// file through sudo (see panel-backup.sudoers), so every subcommand and argument is whitelisted and
// validated here, and every external command runs with an argument array (never a shell string built
// from input). Backups are only ever written to /mnt/backup after checking that it is a real mount on a
// different device than /. Stdlib only: this file must work on its own, outside the repo.
